    "frames": 120,
    "note": "Mega Eelektross floats like the official art: body diagonal, head low and forward, the two cannon arm-tubes alongside, tail rising behind. One driver: a slow hover bob (wave, broad crest, 1 loop = 3.6 s) with a slight pitch rock a beat later. Everything else follows: neck and head nod after the body; the tail and both long arm-tubes carry a travelling wave from root to tip (pitch, then yaw a quarter cycle later, each joint LAG later and a bit bigger), so the free ends lag and sway most; dorsal horn, hip fins, arm fins flutter a beat later; jaws and tube mouths breathe slightly. Floating: nothing planted."
